        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Toss. Aim. Score. Urban Style.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to<strong> Disc Golf City</strong>, an arcade-inspired disc golf game where the concrete jungle becomes your playground. Whether you're curving a disc through alleyways or banking a trick shot off a rooftop, every course is packed with stylish scenery and sneaky targets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate city parks, plazas, and rooftops in this low-poly 3D world, all while unlocking bonus achievements for hitting signs, bins, and hidden targets in your path. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753060/extras/ec402b429a229b5736dd287722e0740e.poster.avif?t=1764629279\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753060/extras/ec402b429a229b5736dd287722e0740e.webm?t=1764629279\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753060/extras/ec402b429a229b5736dd287722e0740e.mp4?t=1764629279\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🥏 <strong>Arcade-style disc golf</strong> set in a familiar city environment</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎯 <strong>Hit the basket</strong>... or go for <strong>bonus trick shot targets</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎨 <strong>Stylized low-poly 3D visuals</strong> with a colorful city vibe</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌆 <strong>Multiple levels</strong> inspired by real city layouts</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >👨‍👩‍👧‍👦 <strong>Family-friendly gameplay</strong> for all ages</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎮 <strong>Simple to play, challenging to master</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧘‍♂️ <strong>Relaxing single-player experience</strong> with no timers and no stress</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753060/extras/802b42be25be00667c4ef5187e90ac5d.poster.avif?t=1764629279\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753060/extras/802b42be25be00667c4ef5187e90ac5d.webm?t=1764629279\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753060/extras/802b42be25be00667c4ef5187e90ac5d.mp4?t=1764629279\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Toss. Aim. Score. Urban Style.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to<strong> Disc Golf City</strong>, an arcade-inspired disc golf game where the concrete jungle becomes your playground. Whether you're curving a disc through alleyways or banking a trick shot off a rooftop, every course is packed with stylish scenery and sneaky targets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate city parks, plazas, and rooftops in this low-poly 3D world, all while unlocking bonus achievements for hitting signs, bins, and hidden targets in your path. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753060/extras/ec402b429a229b5736dd287722e0740e.poster.avif?t=1764629279\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753060/extras/ec402b429a229b5736dd287722e0740e.webm?t=1764629279\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753060/extras/ec402b429a229b5736dd287722e0740e.mp4?t=1764629279\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🥏 <strong>Arcade-style disc golf</strong> set in a familiar city environment</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎯 <strong>Hit the basket</strong>... or go for <strong>bonus trick shot targets</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎨 <strong>Stylized low-poly 3D visuals</strong> with a colorful city vibe</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌆 <strong>Multiple levels</strong> inspired by real city layouts</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >👨‍👩‍👧‍👦 <strong>Family-friendly gameplay</strong> for all ages</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎮 <strong>Simple to play, challenging to master</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧘‍♂️ <strong>Relaxing single-player experience</strong> with no timers and no stress</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753060/extras/802b42be25be00667c4ef5187e90ac5d.poster.avif?t=1764629279\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753060/extras/802b42be25be00667c4ef5187e90ac5d.webm?t=1764629279\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753060/extras/802b42be25be00667c4ef5187e90ac5d.mp4?t=1764629279\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
        "short_description": "Sling discs through stylized cityscapes in this casual, physics-based disc golf game. Aim for the basket or rack up trick shots by bouncing discs off rooftops, signs, and benches in colorful urban environments.",
